  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> be a root of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and the matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the matrix <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
